### ==========================================================
### 记账 + 草稿账单 + 退货
### 先保证 {{token}} 有效，且已有商品（走 test-product.http）
### ==========================================================

### ——— 快捷记账 ———

### 1. 快捷记账（combinationId 从商品列表获取）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/quick
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "buyerName": "散客",
  "items": [
    {
      "combinationId": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

### ——— 草稿账单 ———

### 2. 创建草稿账单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/draft-bills
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 草稿加商品（id 和 combinationId 换成实际值）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/draft-bills/1/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "combinationId": 2,
  "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"红色\",\"尺码\":\"L\"}",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitPrice": 150.00
}

### 4. 获取草稿列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/draft-bills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 删除草稿中的商品
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/draft-bills/1/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 提交草稿
POST http://localhost:8080/api/draft-bills/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "buyerName": "李小姐"
}

### ——— 账单查询 ———

### 7. 今日销售
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 本月销售
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales/month
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ——— 退货 ———

### 9. 退货（saleItemId 从销售明细获取）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/return
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "saleItemId": 1
}
